{"shortDescription":"TORONTO, Oct. 07, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Firan Technology Group Corporation TSX:FTG OTCQX:FTGFF today announced financial results for the third quarter of 2026.Third Quarter Financial Highlights:Business Highlights:In Q3 2026, the Corporation realized significant value from its ongoing strategic…","astDescription":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"p","children":["TORONTO, Oct. 07, 2026 ",{"type":"url","params":{"url":"https://www.globenewswire.com","linkText":"(GLOBE NEWSWIRE)"}}," -- Firan Technology Group Corporation ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"TSX:FTG","text":"TSX:FTG"}}," ","OTCQX:FTGFF"," today announced financial results for the third quarter of 2026."]},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Third Quarter Financial Highlights:"]}]},{"type":"list","children":[{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Bookings"]},": $90.2 million, marking a 75% increase over Q3 2025 and a book-to-bill ratio of 1.41:1"]},{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Backlog"]},": The quarter-end backlog stood at $220.7 million, a 49% rise from the previous year end."]},{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Revenue"]},": $64.1 million in Q3 2026, a 34.3% increase over Q3 2025."]},{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Adjusted EBITDA"]},": $15.1 million in Q3 2026, a 96.9% increase from $7.7 million in Q3 2025; Adjusted EBITDA was $40.8 million for the trailing twelve months."]},{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Net Earnings"]},": $10.0 million in Q3 2026, an increase of $7.2 million from Q3 2025."]},{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Free Cash Flow"]},": Generated $7.1M in Q3 2026."]},{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Net Cash"]},": maintained a strong balance sheet with net cash of $3.9 million, including $8.9 million of government loans. Extinguished all commercial loans during Q3 2026 with cash generated from operations."]}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Business Highlights:"]}]},{"type":"p","children":["In Q3 2026, the Corporation realized significant value from its ongoing strategic initiatives. FTG is investing its capital in ways that will drive increased shareholder returns for the future in both the near term and long term. The company's achievements in Q3 2026 demonstrate this commitment, laying a strong foundation for future growth as evidenced by the record financial metrics, bookings and backlog."]},{"type":"list","children":[{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Growing FTG’s defence business"]},": FTG Circuits qualified for two large-scale classified defence programs in 2025. Significant orders have been placed for these programs and deliveries have ramped up, contributing materially to sales and earnings in Q3 2026."]},{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Operational improvements"]},": Strategic leadership appointments made in 2025 are delivering stronger operating performance and throughput."]},{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Customer demand"]},": Bookings continued at a record pace and many orders included significant pricing premiums for expedited delivery."]},{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"b","children":["International diversification:"]}," The Corporation recently qualified with new customers in Europe and Australia, further diversifying its customer base and reducing exposure to global tariff risks."]},{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Opening of FTG Aerospace Hyderabad: "]},"In Q3 2026, the Corporation opened its new aerospace facility in Hyderabad, India. The new footprint in India reduces the Corporation’s exposure to U.S. tariff risk and provides access to India’s emerging domestic aerospace and defence market."]},{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"b","children":["FTG Circuits Toronto "]},{"type":"b","children":["union agreement: "]},"In Q3 2026, a new four-year collective agreement with represented employees at the Corporation’s Circuits Toronto facility was negotiated and ratified. The agreement expires in July 2030."]},{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Appointment of new auditor: "]},"In Q3 2026, the Corporation appointed Deloitte LLP as its new external auditor."]}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Third Quarter Financial Summary:"]}]},{"type":"table","children":[{"type":"table-body","children":[{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"i","children":["(in thousands of dollars except per share amounts)"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Q3 2026"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Q3 2025"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"b","children":["YTD"]},{"type":"b","children":["Q3 2026"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"b","children":["YTD"]},{"type":"b","children":["Q3 2025"]}]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["Sales"]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"b","children":["64,096"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["47,737"]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"b","children":["164,135"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["139,340"]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["Gross Margin"]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"b","children":["27,492"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["14,486"]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"b","children":["61,302"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["44,800"]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["Gross Margin (%)"]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"b","children":["42.9"]},{"type":"b","children":["%"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["30.3%"]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"b","children":["37.3"]},{"type":"b","children":["%"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["32.2%"]}